WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.9 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Coordination and internal communication

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Reliable hand-offs need a named recipient, an agreed output and a date, even between two co-founders.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start a small weekly check-in and add routines as you grow.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Agree what goes in chat, email and shared folders.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep one decision log from day one.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You define your operating rhythm, channels and one critical hand-off.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
